Vendored copy of Ramulator 2 (MIT license, see LICENSE in this directory).

Upstream: https://github.com/CMU-SAFARI/ramulator2.git
Commit:   c6c7a5d (main, 2026-10-09)
          "integrate Ayna HBM power model
          (CMU-SAFARI/HBM-Power@318d3d1) (#281)"

The tree was copied with
  git -C <ramulator2 clone> archive c6c7a5d | tar -x -C ext/ramulator2
and is modified in place in this repository.

