--------

| Component   | Version        | Commit                                   | License |
|-------------|----------------|------------------------------------------|---------|
| Ramulator 2 | 2.1            | c6c7a5d                                  | MIT     |
| yaml-cpp    | yaml-cpp-0.9.0 | 56e3bb550c91fd7005566f19c079cb7a503223cf | MIT     |
| fmt         | 10.2.1         | e69e5f977d458f2650bb346dadf2ad30c5320281 | MIT     |
| nanobind    | v2.4.0         | 0f9ce749b257fdfe701edb3cf6f7027ba029434a | BSD-3   |
